WEBVTT

00:11:28.284 --> 00:11:31.665
but backwards, from the last
word to the first.

00:11:31.689 --> 00:11:33.377
(Laughter)

00:11:33.401 --> 00:11:38.094
So when I heard that I was like --
that's uncanny,

00:11:38.118 --> 00:11:40.595
that's exactly what my creative
process is like.

00:11:40.619 --> 00:11:44.208
(Laughter)

00:11:44.232 --> 00:11:47.574
That's not at all what my creative
process is -- I'm not the pipeline!

00:11:47.598 --> 00:11:49.628
I'm a mule, and the way
that I have to work

00:11:49.652 --> 00:11:51.895
is I have to get up
at the same time every day,

00:11:51.919 --> 00:11:54.729
and sweat and labor and barrel
through it really awkwardly.

00:11:54.753 --> 00:11:56.592
But even I, in my mulishness,

00:11:56.616 --> 00:12:00.460
even I have brushed
up against that thing, at times.